  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
    <div class="badge rounded-circle bg-green-subtle text-green p-3 mb-4 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 72px; height: 72px; background: rgba(17,106,66,0.1); color: #116A42;">
      <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" style="font-size: 2.5rem;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </div>

    <h1 class="h2 font-weight-bold text-ink mb-3" style="color: var(--ss-ink, #362B24);">We Received Your Free First Visit Request!</h1>
    <p class="lead text-muted mb-4" style="color: var(--ss-muted, #4F433C); font-size: 1.15rem;">
      Thank you for reaching out. Sensei Sandy will text or call you shortly to confirm the details below.
    </p>

    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 text-start rounded-4 mb-4" style="background: var(--ss-surface2, #F4F1ED); border-left: 5px solid var(--ss-green, #116A42) !important;">
      <h2 class="h5 font-weight-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--ss-ink, #362B24);">What Happens Next:</h2>
      <ol class="mb-0 ps-3" style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ss-muted, #4F433C);">
        <li class="mb-2"><strong>Appointment confirmation:</strong> Sandy will reach out via text or phone to confirm your first visit.</li>
        <li class="mb-2" data-confirmation-adult><strong>Adult:</strong> Your 15-minute Goal Mapping visit is in normal clothes. Meet Sandy, see the room, and choose your free coached first class.</li>
        <li class="mb-2" data-confirmation-youth><strong>Child or teen:</strong> Arrive 20 minutes before your selected 5 PM class in athletic clothes. Meet Sandy, review safety, and your student may train that day.</li>
        <li class="mb-0"><strong>Bring:</strong> 6045 Main St, 2nd Floor; your selected class time and Gi/No-Gi option; and the waiver completed before arrival.</li>
      </ol>
      <div id="first-visit-details" class="mt-3 pt-3 border-top" hidden>
        <strong>Your selected first-visit details</strong>
        <p class="small mb-0 mt-2" data-confirmation-details></p>
      </div>
